'''Divi's Laboratories Limited''' is an Indian [[Multinational corporation|multinational]] [[Medication|pharmaceutical]] company and producer of [[Active ingredient|active pharmaceutical ingredients]] (APIs) and intermediates, headquartered in [[Hyderabad]].<ref>{{Cite web|title=Company Profile-DIVIS LAB|url=https://stock-financials.valuestocks.in/en/divis-lab-company-profile|access-date=2020-09-15|website=Dynamic Levels|language=en-US|archive-date=18 October 2020|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20201018134310/https://stock-financials.valuestocks.in/en/divis-lab-company-profile|url-status=live}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web|title=Company Profile for Divi's Laboratories Ltd|url=https://in.reuters.com/finance/stocks/company-profile/DIVI.BO|access-date=2020-09-15|work=Reuters|archive-date=18 October 2017|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20171018154537/http://in.reuters.com/finance/stocks/company-profile/DIVI.BO|url-status=dead}}</ref><ref name="bb">{{Cite web|title=Divi's Laboratories Ltd Company profile|url=https://www.bloomberg.com/profile/company/DIVI:IN|url-status=live|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20201018134310/https://www.bloomberg.com/profile/company/DIVI:IN|archive-date=18 October 2020|access-date=2020-09-15|publisher=Bloomberg L.P.}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web|title=DIVI'S LABORATORIES LIMITED - Company, directors and contact details {{!}} Zauba Corp|url=https://www.zaubacorp.com/company/DIVI-S-LABORATORIES-LIMITED/L24110TG1990PLC011854|access-date=2020-09-15|website=www.zaubacorp.com|archive-date=18 October 2020|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20201018134313/https://www.zaubacorp.com/company/DIVI-S-LABORATORIES-LIMITED/L24110TG1990PLC011854|url-status=live}}</ref> The company manufactures and custom synthesizes generic APIs, intermediates.<ref>{{Cite web|title=Top API Manufacturing Company In Hyderabad, India & World {{!}} DivisLabs|url=https://www.divislabs.com/api-manufacturing-company/|access-date=2020-09-15|website=Divis Laboratories World’s largest API manufacturing facility|language=en-US|archive-date=12 August 2020|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20200812025954/https://www.divislabs.com/api-manufacturing-company/|url-status=live}}</ref><ref>{{Cite web|last=Bradstreet|first=Dun|title=Divi's Laboratories company profile|url=https://www.dnb.com/business-directory/company-profiles.divis_laboratories_limited.344527b03327427e0ce523821ee82d40.html|access-date=|website=dnb.com|archive-date=18 October 2020|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20201018134332/https://www.dnb.com/business-directory/company-profiles.divis_laboratories_limited.344527b03327427e0ce523821ee82d40.html|url-status=live}}</ref> The company also manufactures and supplies [[nutraceutical]] ingredients through its subsidiary, Divi's Nutraceuticals.<ref name=":1">{{Cite web |last=Divis Nutraceuticals |date=2021-09-14 |title=Press Release: Divi's Nutraceuticals launches CaroNat for natural food and beverage coloration |url=https://divisnutraceuticals.com/press-release-divis-nutraceuticals-launches-caronat-for-natural-food-and-beverage-coloration/ |access-date=2022-07-27 |website=Divi's Nutraceuticals |language=en-US}}</ref> Divi's Laboratories is India's fourth largest publicly listed [[Medication|pharmaceutical]] company by [[market capitalization]].<ref>{{cite news |title=Top Pharmaceuticals & Drugs Stocks in India by Market Capitalisation |url=https://www.moneycontrol.com/stocks/marketinfo/marketcap/bse/pharmaceuticals-drugs.html |access-date=15 February 2023 |work=www.moneycontrol.com |language=en |archive-date=13 January 2023 |archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20230113195129/https://www.moneycontrol.com/stocks/marketinfo/marketcap/bse/pharmaceuticals-drugs.html |url-status=live }}</ref>

== History ==
The company initially started developing commercial processes for the manufacturing of APIs and intermediates. Divi's Research Centre changed its name to Divi's Laboratories Limited in 1994 to signal its intent to enter the API and intermediates manufacturing industry.<ref name="mc">{{Cite web|title=Divis Laboratories > Company History > Pharmaceuticals > Company History of Divis Laboratories - BSE: 532488, NSE: DIVISLAB|url=https://www.moneycontrol.com/company-facts/divislaboratories/history/dl03|access-date=2020-09-17|website=moneycontrol.com|language=en|archive-date=6 June 2020|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20200606223407/https://www.moneycontrol.com/company-facts/divislaboratories/history/DL03|url-status=live}}</ref> Following this, the company established its first Manufacturing facility in 1995 at [[Choutuppal]], [[Telangana]].<ref name=ar/> In 2002, the company's second manufacturing facility commenced operations at Chippada near [[Visakhapatnam]].<ref name=ar/>

The company went public with its [[initial public offering]] (IPO) on 17 February 2003.<ref>{{Cite web|date=2003-02-11|title=Divis Labs Fixes Rs 130 Per Share As Floor Price For IPO|url=https://www.financialexpress.com/archive/divis-labs-fixes-rs-130-per-share-as-floor-price-for-ipo/72906/|access-date=2020-09-18|website=The Financial Express|language=en-US|archive-date=17 March 2018|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20180317125855/http://www.financialexpress.com/archive/divis-labs-fixes-rs-130-per-share-as-floor-price-for-ipo/72906/|url-status=live}}</ref><ref name="mc"/> In 2010, the company established a research centre in [[Hyderabad]].<ref name=ar/>

== Facilities ==
The company has three manufacturing facilities and three R&D centres across India:<ref name=ar>{{Cite web|last=Laboratories|first=Divi's|title=Annual Report|url=https://www.divislabs.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/09/30th-Divi-Annual-Report.pdf|url-status=live|archive-url=https://web.archive.org/web/20201018134305/https://www.divislabs.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/09/30th-Divi-Annual-Report.pdf|archive-date=18 October 2020|access-date=|website=divislabs.com}}</ref>

